1) make it directly in "without support" time, or
2) first obtain its supporting tool, then make it in the reduced "with support" time.

The supporting tool itself can be produced in the same optimal way, so this forms a dependency graph.
We need the minimum total days to produce all ordered tools, where once a tool is produced, it can be reused as support for any number of other tools.
Thus we want the minimum time to obtain the whole required set of ordered tools.

